      "writtenOn": "2020-04-20T14:57:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that the check is generic to java, it does not care in which binary the library ends up eventually. These two are needed for some tests (not 100% why, as they are added as DefaultLibraries) and some other existing java_library that already set min_sdk_version (outside of mainline requirement).",
