      "writtenOn": "2020-04-22T10:01:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "s/agree/follow/\n\nI\u0027ve also lost a track here to be honest. What\u0027s the proposal here? That I move this check to \nAndroidApp and only check for static_libs?",
      "parentUuid": "f1def97f_34063fb6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 158,
